<title>FRANCE: French car sales up 25 percent in October - sources.</title>
<headline>French car sales up 25 percent in October - sources.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>French car sales increased 25 percent in October, up by more than 200,000 vehicles compared to the same month a year ago when 162,800 cars were sold, industrial sources said based on provisional data for the month.</p>
<p>The French car industry body is scheduled to release the official sales data on Monday November 4.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
